      "writtenOn": "2024-07-03T20:14:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to the recent chat thread discussion, synchronization should be very cheap, unless you call wait on the lock object. \n\nVolatile may or may not be faster than synchronization, but given the team situation / etc -- there\u0027s a bigger chance it\u0027d be unnoticed even if it causes a regression coz there are less people + trunk stale -- let\u0027s play it safe and prioritize reducing potential risks?\n\nI think synchronization is safer, so let\u0027s just do it. We don\u0027t really need to spend too much time on it.",
      "parentUuid": "13d3bc85_e35345cc",
      "revId": "bd516fe337faeec9beb297310e9a145ab24d23c9",
